Treasure Hunter Leader","Why can't you just give us a break? We kept our heads down this time, working an honest job. Why are you still coming after us?!",0,""],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,200.0,-50.0,1.2,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_111","e","005",0.28,-0.07,1.1,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_111","e",null,null,0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_111","e",null,"awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_111","That's rich coming from you.==W== You threw the first punch.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_111","e","009","resentful",null,null,null,null,"buman","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_111","e",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutQuad",0.7,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.7],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_211","b","007","shock",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","So ... you aren't here to mess up our job?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"v","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","We were just looking for someone to ask about the rumors. Unless you're up to something shady again?",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,"flurry",null,null,null,null,"jinzhang","Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","No! We've been busting our tails day and night, trying to save up for our travels.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"v","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Oh... Okay. I thought you might be the ones behind the urban legends.",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.6],["ctl","avg1_111","a",null,null,0.78,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.6],["w",0.6],["ctl","avg3_211","b","005","vexation",null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","No kidding! We're the victims here!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","Working here was tough, sure, but business was booming. Good revenue meant good bonuses, and the owner paid out.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b","011","angry",null,null,null,null,"buman","Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","Then, out of nowhere, weird rumors started circulating. Gaze in the dark, shadows, Scissorhands... And they keep getting wilder.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_052"],["chd",0,2,"avg1_160","b","020",null],["stg",0,-100.0,null,null,"OutQuad",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_160","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_160","I imagine those rumors hit business pretty hard.",0,""],["stg",0,0.0,null,null,"OutSine",1.0,null,null,null],["chd",1,2,"avg1_160","a","002",null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,"jushou0","Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","You bet. Business completely tanked! People would check in for the night and demand a refund by morning. Others would cancel their reservations the second they heard the stories.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","Sure, we get a few thrill-seekers looking for living urban legends, but that amounts to nothing.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b","008","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","The crowds kept shrinking and that really brought the resort owner down. He eventually gave up on running the front desk and shoved the whole staff into hunting down those supernatural incidents.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b","005","vexation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","At this rate, we're going to fail our performance reviews and lose our jobs!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"v","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","But those stories didn't come from nowhere. Something has to be going on here.==W== Have you witnessed anything strange yourselves?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"v","002","question",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b","008","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","Well... We aren't supposed to go around spreading rumors.",0,""],["show","avg1_160","b","002",0.8,null,null,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_160","b",null,null,0.75,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.7],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.7],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_160","b","010","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_160","Don't worry, we're here to help. Whatever you tell us stays between us. We aren't looking to cause trouble.",0,""],["show","avg2_991","b","007",0.2,-0.07,-1.1,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["se","se)_236"],["ctl","avg2_991","b",null,null,0.2,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.6],["ctl","avg3_211","b","011",null,0.4,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.6],["ctl","avg1_160","b","004",null,0.75,-0.3,1.3,null,null,"OutSine",0.6],["stg",0,200.0,-50.0,1.2,"OutSine",0.6,null,null,null],["w",1],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_160","b",null,null,0.8,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","Talkative Treasure Hunter","Cap...==W== Maybe we should tell them? It's not like we have any better options.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_991","b",null,"sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b","004","sigh",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["w",1],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg3_211","b","007",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",2.0],["ctl","avg3_211","b","008",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","Alright...==W== We did run into some weird stuff.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m14"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","beach_night",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_037"],["w",0.5],["se","se_540"],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","Lately we keep hearing this click-clack noise at night, and getting the feeling that something's watching us from the dark.",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_143"],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","Every night, massive drag marks are carved on the beach, and we have to rake them over before sunrise so that the guests don't freak out.",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,1],["w",1],["bg","beach_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_211","b","008",null,-0.07,1.1,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_037_stop"],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,"awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","But the weirdest thing of all is that Automatic Vending Artifact.",0,""],["show","avg1_112","d","005",0.2,null,null,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","d",null,null,0.3,null,null,1.0,"2TiaoYue","OutQuad",0.6],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.6],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_112","d","005","attention",null,null,null,null,"huanxin","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Oh, I heard about that one! The Human-Eating Vending Artifact, right?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_211","b","007","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Treasure Hunter Leader","Sounds like somebody exaggerated that story. But we did see the Artifact move on its own.",0,""],["show","avg2_991","b","002",0.8,null,null,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","d",null,null,0.25,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.7],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg3_211","b",null,null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg2_991","b",null,null,0.7,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.7],["stg",0,-200.0,-50.0,1.25,"OutSine",0.7,null,null,null],